{"type":"TEXT","ticket":808,"id":"29dd9b7882f0d197"}||{"x":100,"y":-750,"rotation":0,"color":"#213547","fontFamily":null,"fontSize":9,"fontWeight":false,"italic":false,"underline":false,"align":"LEFT_TOP","value":"核心板在下：TOP = TFM-115-02-L-D-A\n扩展板在上：BOTTOM = SFM-115-02-L-D-A-K-TR\n两组 30pin；装配方向与旧版相反；禁止沿用旧 50pin 针序\n5V_PORT 与 3V3_AUX 均为受限流保护的输出，不接外部电源","fillColor":"#213547","zIndex":682}